	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By forgoing stealth, you provide your group protection against fatigue on long haul travel. The first time each member of your party fails their saving throw against a forced march and would gain fatigue, they are able to reroll that saving throw. Each party member can benefit from this once. In exchange, any perception or investigation checks made to track the party gain advantage.</p>",
